orized<svg class=\"caret\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6b7480\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><span style=\"color: #9aa2ad;\">Manufacturer</span><svg class=\"caret\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6b7480\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg></div>\n\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 9px;\">\n        <div class=\"field\"><span class=\"flabel\">Average Cost</span>$ 10.00</div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><span class=\"flabel\">Sell Price</span>$ 40.00</div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><span class=\"flabel\">Core Charge</span>$ 25.00</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 9px;\">\n        <div class=\"field\"><span class=\"flabel\">Min</span>0</div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><span class=\"flabel\">Max</span>0</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"field\"><span style=\"color: #9aa2ad;\">Tags</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"secthd\">Inventory</div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;\">\n        <div class=\"field\" style=\"flex: 1;\"><span class=\"flabel\">Bin Location</span>General Storage<svg class=\"caret\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6b7480\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"field\" style=\"width: 74px;\"><span class=\"flabel\">Quantity</span>1</div>\n        <div style=\"border: 1px solid #2563EB; color: #2563EB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 3px 11px; font-size: 11.5px;\">Default</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"link\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Add Bin Location</div>\n\n      <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 9px; margin-top: 4px;\">\n        <div class=\"btn btn--danger\">Delete</div>\n        <div class=\"btn btn--primary\">Save</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cap\">\n      <p style=\"margin-top: 0;\"><strong style=\"color: #7a1020;\">Catalog Part is required, and it is the first thing on the screen.</strong> An inventory part cannot exist unless a matching catalog part already does, so adding one part off the shelf means creating two records in two places, in the right order. It is drawn in the required blue, which is the only field on the dialog that is.</p>\n      <p><strong style=\"color: #7a1020;\">There is no status anywhere on this dialog.</strong> A part cannot be retired from here, and nothing on the screen suggests retiring is possible at all.</p>\n      <p><strong style=\"color: #7a1020;\">Min and Max sit loose between Core Charge and Tags,</strong> with nothing saying what they belong to or when they matter. Every part has them, because every part is tracked.</p>\n      <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">The destructive action available here is <strong>Delete</strong>, which removes the part outright. There is no middle option between keeping a part in everyone's way and deleting it.</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</x-dc>\n</body>\n</html>\n", "create-01-p1-1-new-empty.dc.html": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <script src=\"./support.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<x-dc>\n<helmet>\n  <title>1.1 New Inventory Part opens</title>\n  <style>\n    body { margin: 0; background: #ffffff; }\n    img { display: block; width: 1600px; height: 1100px; }\n  </style>\n</helmet>\n<img alt=\"1.1 New Inventory Part opens\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n</x-dc>\n</body>\n</html>\n", "create-02-p1-2-required.dc.html": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <script src=\"./support.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<x-dc>\n<helmet>\n  <title>1.2 Save with nothing filled</title>\n  <sty